@startuml
title MRD-244: ParallelOrchestrator Persistence Fix (NightShift)
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members

class ParallelOrchestrator {
  +store : Store
  +config : Config
  +max_workers : Optional[int]
  +output_qc : Dict[Tuple[str,int], Optional[AnomalyReport]]
  --
  +__init__(store : Store, config : Config = DEFAULT, max_workers : Optional[int] = None)
  +prepare(targets : Sequence[StationYear]) : List[PreparedRun]
  +run(prepared : Sequence[PreparedRun], run_at : str) : Tuple[List[Modelled], List[RunOutcome]]
  +persist(modelled : Sequence[Modelled], run_at : str) : Dict[Tuple[str,int], Modelled]
}

class PreparedRun <<frozen dataclass>> {
  +target : StationYear
  +spec : ModelInputSpec
  +/stnid : str
  +/year : int
}

class Modelled <<frozen dataclass>> {
  +target : StationYear
  +result : ForecastResult
  +summary : SeasonSummary
  +elapsed_s : float
  +deck_days : int
}

class RunOutcome <<dataclass>> {
  +target : StationYear
  +ok : bool
  +yield_t : Optional[float]
  +ndays : Optional[int]
  +dropped_days : int
  +elapsed_s : float
  +error : Optional[str]
}

class StationYear <<frozen dataclass>> {
  +stnid : str
  +year : int
}

class Store {
  +save_result(result : ForecastResult, run_at : str) : None
}

class Config <<frozen dataclass>> {
  +model_binary : str
  +run_timeout_s : int
  +scratch_root : Optional[str]
  +scratch_prefix : str
  +keep_scratch : bool
  +db_path : str
  +qc_enabled : bool
  +qc_blocking : bool
  +qc : QCLimits
  +output_qc_enabled : bool
  +stop_on_error : bool
}

ParallelOrchestrator ..> PreparedRun : prepare() produces
ParallelOrchestrator ..> PreparedRun : run() consumes
ParallelOrchestrator ..> Modelled : run() produces
ParallelOrchestrator ..> Modelled : persist() consumes
ParallelOrchestrator ..> RunOutcome : run() produces on failure
ParallelOrchestrator --> Store : uses
ParallelOrchestrator --> Config : reads

PreparedRun --> StationYear : target
Modelled --> StationYear : target
RunOutcome --> StationYear : target

note right of ParallelOrchestrator::persist
  **MRD-244 fix**
  Before: collected keyed by //stnid// alone
    -> whichever run finished last overwrote
       the other years of that station
  After: keyed by //(stnid, year)//
    -> every station-year persisted independently
  output_qc already used (stnid, year) as its key,
  so the old stnid-only dict was inconsistent with it.
end note
@enduml